  "title": "SunCoke Energy, Inc. Declares Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "LISLE, Ill.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- Today, SunCoke Energy, Inc. (NYSE: SXC) announced that its Board of Directors declared a cash dividend of $0.12 per share of the Company’s common stock to be paid on September 2, 2026 to stockholders of record at the close of business on August 17, 2026.ABOUT SUNCOKE ENERGY, INC.SunCoke",
